cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kestrix in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kestrix: a local-first security workbench"
abstract: >-
  Kestrix is a local-first security workbench with four modules: Sigma
  detection repair validated by replay on a pinned Elasticsearch, file and
  URL forensics, passive website exposure checks, and Bitcoin quantum
  key-exposure scanning. It ships as one Python package with a CLI and a
  local dashboard.
authors:
